# Project: AI-Powered Learning Assistant

Full-stack MERN web application.

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technologies |
|---|---|
| Frontend | React, Vite, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, React Router, Axios |
| Backend | Node.js, Express.js, TypeScript, JWT, bcryptjs, Multer |
| Database | MongoDB Atlas, Mongoose |
| AI | Google Gemini API |
| Deploy | Vercel (frontend), Render (backend), MongoDB Atlas |

## Folder Structure

```
client/   ← React frontend
server/   ← Node.js backend
```

Always teach folder structure before creating files. Explain why each folder exists.

## UI

The learner will provide a UI design/screenshot for each page before building it.
Do not assume any UI layout. Wait for the learner to share the design before implementing any page.

---

## Features

### Authentication

- Register
- Login
- Forgot Password
- Change Password
- JWT Authentication
- Protected Routes

---

### Dashboard

Display:
- Total Documents
- Total Flashcards
- Total Quizzes
- Average Quiz Score

Charts:
- Study Time
- Quiz Score

Recent Activities:
- Recently Uploaded Documents
- Recently Generated Flashcards
- Recently Completed Quizzes

---

### Documents

Features:
- Upload PDF
- View Documents
- Search Documents
- Rename Document
- Delete Document
- Favorite Document

Each document displays:
- Document Name
- Upload Date
- File Size
- Total Pages
- Flashcards Count
- Quiz Count

---

### Document Details

#### Embedded PDF Viewer
Display the uploaded PDF inside the application.

#### AI Chat (Google Gemini)
User can ask questions related to the uploaded document.

Display:
- Chat History
- User Messages
- AI Responses

#### AI Summary
Generate:
- Document Summary
- Key Points
- Important Concepts

Allow downloading the generated summary.

#### Flashcards
Generate AI flashcards from the uploaded document.

Options:
- Generate 5
- Generate 10
- Generate 20

Display:
- Question
- Answer

Support:
- Flip Animation
- Favorite
- Delete

#### Quizzes
Generate quizzes using Gemini.

Options:
- Number of Questions (configurable)

Display:
- Multiple Choice Questions

Result:
- Score
- Correct Answers
- Wrong Answers
- Explanation

---

### Flashcards Page

Display all flashcards.

Features:
- Search
- Filter by Document
- Favorite
- Delete
- Flip Animation

---

### Quizzes Page

Display:
- Quiz List
- Quiz History
- Scores

Allow:
- Review Answers
- View AI Explanation

---

### Profile

Display:
- Profile Photo
- Name
- Email

Features:
- Upload Avatar
- Change Password
- Update Profile

---

### Additional Features

- Download AI-generated Summary
- Study Streak
- Favorite Documents
